IVNGENTVRTITVLISFELICIAFACTANEPOTVM</P> <P COM="0397"><HI REND="ITALIC">In hoc carmine a monogrammo Jesu oritur principium lectionis, ut pectore levetur obscuritas. In qua duo versus
 <COL N="0399"></COL> Graece sunt, incipientes a laeva parte monogrammi, ex quibus unus ejusdem signi reliquis partibus functus, media
littera N terminatur,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0399"><L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Thún nauðn ajeiú, kovsmon kev de aærmenon eijnoikivzein</FOREIGN>  ( <HI REND="ITALIC">Stc</HI> ).</L></POEM> 

 <HI REND="ITALIC">Alter inde descendens ad alveum navis, speciem gubernaculi partis suae fine concludit. Qui est talis,</HI> 

 <POEM COM="0399"><L><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>Ouæroiû teinovmenon shðû ajrethðû ajnevmoiû.</FOREIGN></L></POEM> 

 <HI REND="ITALIC">Versus vero qui aut a prora incipiunt, aut a rostro, aut a remis, aut sub prora, extremo puppis acumine terminali,
texta vicere, alii vota circumcludunt. Qui sunt tales,</HI> 

 <POEM COM="0399"><L>Navita nunc tutus contemnat summe procellas,</L> <L>Nigras nunc tutus contemnat summe procellas,</L> <L>Tutus contemnat summis cumulata tropaeis.</L> <L>Pulsa mente mala contemnat summe procellas.</L> <L>Spe quoque Roma bona contemnat summe procellas.</L> <L>Roma felix floret semper votis tuis.</L></POEM></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0399" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0399">V.</HEAD> <COL N="0399"></COL> <P COM="0399"><ORNAMENT IMAGE="0190399A" TEXT="[Carmen]"></ORNAMENT> <NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="0401"><COL N="0401"></COL> <P COM="0401">Vers. 1.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Fragrarem.</HI>  Pith. p. 351.  <HI REND="ITALIC">flagrarem.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0401">9.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Laetus.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">saetus.</HI>  Male.</P> 

 <P COM="0401">20.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Devia vota.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">d. voto.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0401"><COL N="0402"></COL> 26.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tanto cui munere.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">t. cur mun.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0402">30.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cito perferat.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">cata perf.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0402">32.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Reddere detur.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">r. retur.</HI></P> 

 <CAPTION COM="0402"><COL N="0401"></COL> IN LEMMA CARMINI SUBJECTUM.</CAPTION> 

 <P COM="0401"><HI REND="ITALIC">Tali se carmine.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">tuli si carm.</HI>  Male.</P> 

 <P COM="0401"><HI REND="ITALIC">Penultimam.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">paene ultimam.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0401"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ad ultimam sui.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">ad ult. sic.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0401"><HI REND="ITALIC">Penultimam.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">paene ultim.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0401"><COL N="0402"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Item ad octavam decim.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Iterum ab octava
decima.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0402"><HI REND="ITALIC">Orthogona.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">octogona.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0402"><HI REND="ITALIC">Et decrescentia.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">vel discrescentia.</HI></P></NOTE>   <NOTE N="1" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0401" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0401"></COL> Fraglarem.</NOTE>  FINGEREMVSARVMFRAGRAREMNVMINEVVLTVS
