ORBISVOTATVIGENTESSIBIIVNGEVOLENTES</P> <P COM="0403"><HI REND="ITALIC">In isto carmine tricenae quinae litterae sunt. Sed acrostichis cum telostichide juncta facit versum,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0403"><L>Certa salus rerum, proles invicta tonantis.</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0403"><HI REND="ITALIC">In qua secunda littera noni versus designat,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0403"><L>Orbi tu renovas felicis tempora saecli.</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0403"><HI REND="ITALIC">Item a secunda decimi versus littera, ad penultimam ejusdem bis ascendens et bis descendens rubrica, continet
versum hunc,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0403"><L>Aurea justitiae terris insignia donas.</L></POEM></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0403" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0403">VIII.</HEAD> <COL N="0403"></COL> <P COM="0403"><ORNAMENT IMAGE="0190403B" TEXT="[Carmen]"></ORNAMENT> <NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="0403"><COL N="0403"></COL> <P COM="0403">Vers. 4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tu vatem.</HI>  Vide  <HI REND="ITALIC">Valesium</HI>  ad Euseb. H.
