OMNIALAETENTVRFLORENTIBVSAVREAREBVS</P> <P COM="0413"><COL N="0413"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">In hac pagina tricenae quinae litterae sunt: In qua Christi monogrammum rubrica depictum est, per quam a
primi versus littera prima ad ultimam novissimi linea decurrens continet,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0413"><L>Summi Dei auxilio nutuque perpetuo tutus;</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0413"><HI REND="ITALIC">Et a prima ultimi versus littera ad novissimam primi per obliquum ascendit scriptura haec,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0413"><L>Orbem totum pacavit trucidatis tyrannis.</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0413"><HI REND="ITALIC">A media littera primi versus usque ad mediam ultimi per directum descendit rubrica continens,</HI> <POEM COM="0413"><L>Constantinus pius et aeternus imperator;</L></POEM></P> <P COM="0413"><HI REND="ITALIC">Inflexio quae graecam litteram facit scriptum habet,</HI> 
 <POEM COM="0413"><L>Reparator orbis.</L></POEM></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0413" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0413">XVII.</HEAD> <COL N="0415"></COL> <P COM="0415"><ORNAMENT IMAGE="0190415A" TEXT="[Carmen]"></ORNAMENT> <NOTE TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=N BLOCK=YES COM="0417"><COL N="0417"></COL> <P COM="0417">Vers. 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Perenne.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">perenni.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0417">3  <HI REND="ITALIC">Summe fave.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Summa fave.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0417">12.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Roma fluit.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Roma cluit.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0417">16.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Curis sub.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Curiis sub.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0417">18.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pietate secuta.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Pietate secura,</HI>  male.</P> 

 <P COM="0417">21.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Tuas sedes.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">suas sedes.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0417">23.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Opes.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Opus.</HI></P> 

