 <CAPTION COM="0429">IN LEMMA CARMINI SUBJECTUM.</CAPTION> 

 <P COM="0429"><HI REND="ITALIC">In qua a prima littera pr. v. rubrica descendens.</HI> Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">in qua prima littera primi v. per obliquum lubrica
descend.</HI></P> 

