primi versus prope medietatem.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0430"><HI REND="ITALIC">Telostichidis.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">telestichidis.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0430"><HI REND="ITALIC">Alternis utraque utrique. Utraque</HI>  abest a Pith.</P> 

 <P COM="0430"><HI REND="ITALIC">Pagina aliae novem.</HI>  Post haec inseruntur in Pith.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">et item ultra mediam paginam pari ordine aliae novem,
et item in telestichide aliae novem fac. vers.</HI></P> 

 <P COM="0430"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ad</HI>  XXIII  <HI REND="ITALIC">telostichidis f. v.</HI>  Pith.  <HI REND="ITALIC">a vicessima tertia
telestichidis littera faciunt versum.</HI></P> 

