 <NOTE N="76." TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0541" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0541D"></COL> Reg. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sapientiae,</HI>  sed a sec. m.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">sapienti,</HI>  cum
