eximio Syncletices <NOTE N="78." TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0542" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0542B"></COL> Vat. 1, 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sincleticis.</HI>  Reg. 1, 2, et ut videtur,
