in quo Dominus habitet <NOTE N="79." TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0542" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0542D"></COL> Nonnulli ediderunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">habitat:</HI>  sic Ott. 1 et Reg.
