 <P COM="0693">233. Reg. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">De muliere in adulterio deprehensa.</HI> 
Meus,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mulier absolvitur adulterii reatu.</HI>  Cant. Arntz.,
Urb., Rom., Meus, ed. Lips., Ald.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Cumque:</HI>  plerique
 <COL N="0694C"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Dumque.</HI>  Reg. 2., Ott. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">media residens:</HI>  alii  <HI REND="ITALIC">residens
media.</HI>  Vat. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">residens medii.</HI>  Virgilius vero, ex quo
Sedulius proficit, l. I Aeneid. vers. 509,  <HI REND="ITALIC">Media testudine
