 <HI REND="ITALIC">Christus Dei virtus, et Dei sapientia.</HI>  Spiritus scientiae
 <NOTE N="e" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789B"></COL> Diess., corrupte,  <HI REND="ITALIC">propter imminentia Christo
scientia Jesu Apostoli.</HI>  Apostolus ad Ephes. III, 19,
