timor</HI> <NOTE N="g" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789C"></COL> Diess. addit  <HI REND="ITALIC">Dei</HI>  post  <HI REND="ITALIC">timoris.</HI></NOTE>   <HI REND="ITALIC">Domini</HI>   <CITN>(Psal. 110, 6)</CITN> .</P> <DIV2 SECOND=YES COM="0789"><HEAD COM="0789"><HI REND="ITALIC">Multiformis autem nominum Christi</HI> <NOTE N="h" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789C"></COL> Vat. 1,  <HI REND="ITALIC">disertatio est;</HI>  fortasse genuina est lectio
