holocaustum. Pastor;</HI>  quod Vat. 1 praetermittit.</NOTE> , quia custos <NOTE N="l" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789C"></COL> Vat. 2, Diess. omittunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">ovium</HI>  post  <HI REND="ITALIC">custos.</HI>  Uterque
hic codex post  <HI REND="ITALIC">custos</HI>  illico  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vermis, quia resurrexit,</HI> 
quod deest in Vatic. 1.</NOTE>  ovium.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Mons,</HI>  quia
