per ipsum ingressus in vitam est.</HI></NOTE>  ad
vitam.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Agnus,</HI>  quia <NOTE N="n" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789D"></COL> Diess.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">passus est. Lapis, quia instructio angularis.</HI> 
Vat. 2,  <HI REND="ITALIC">passus. Lapis angularis, quia instructio.</HI></NOTE>  passus.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Lapis angularis,</HI>  quia
 <COL N="0790A"></COL> constructio.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Magister,</HI>  quia ostensor vitae.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Sol,</HI> <NOTE N="o" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789D"></COL> Diess.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia illuminat.</HI></NOTE> 
quia illuminator.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Verus,</HI>  quia a Patre.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Vita,</HI> <NOTE N="p" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789D"></COL> Diess., Vat. 2,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia creator.</HI></NOTE>  quia
rector.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Panis,</HI>  quia caro.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Samaritanus,</HI>  quia custos,
et misericors.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Christus,</HI>  quia unctus.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Jesus,</HI>  quia salvator.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">Deus,</HI>  quia ex Deo <NOTE N="q" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789D"></COL> Diess., Vat. 2 omittunt  <HI REND="ITALIC">est</HI>  post  <HI REND="ITALIC">Deo,</HI>  quod alii
exhibent.</NOTE>  est.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Angelus,</HI> <NOTE N="r" TYPE="Scholia" ANCHORED=Y COM="0789" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0789D"></COL> Diess.,  <HI REND="ITALIC">quia missus.</HI></NOTE>  quia
